{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asra Diwal is a masterful evader who steers clear of all responsibility, but problems always turn out to be much faster than she is. In an effort to secure an easy and carefree life as Inspector Choir's servant, she is unwittingly forced to carry out an investigation and save her own life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city of Devas is full of dark wonders and mysterious creatures, and its past is eager to bring back memories of itself. But as you push forward in the relentless search for secrets, you may stumble upon a spark of love! And pass it by.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221720/extras/6e1f376fd979977f8e1e0a9013fb8d5c.webp?t=1770888001\" width=38 height=38 /></span>A story where your choices matter </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221720/extras/6e1f376fd979977f8e1e0a9013fb8d5c.webp?t=1770888001\" width=38 height=38 /></span>Three romantic interests with their own secrets for you to uncover. Or you could leave them alone and deal with your own problems instead  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221720/extras/6e1f376fd979977f8e1e0a9013fb8d5c.webp?t=1770888001\" width=38 height=38 /></span>A mystical tale set in the world of the distant future where humans are not the only sapient beings around  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221720/extras/6e1f376fd979977f8e1e0a9013fb8d5c.webp?t=1770888001\" width=38 height=38 /></span>Seven endings (and a few silly deaths) </p>","background":"https